Package: soryos-identity
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SoryOS Team <maintainers@soryos.local>
Description: SoryOS operating system identity files
 This package provides SoryOS identity templates and a safe helper to apply
 SoryOS branding to os-release, lsb-release, and issue files. It does not
 replace Ubuntu, Debian, kernel, bootloader, apt, dpkg, or systemd packages.
Section: admin
Priority: optional
